#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Erik Sandberg-Diment|title=PERSONAL COMPUTERS;   DESIGNING IS MADE EASY BY AUTOCAD|magazine=w:The New York Times|url=https://www.nytimes.com/1985/11/19/science/personal-computers-designing-is-made-easy-by-autocad.html|date=1985-11-19|passage=The mechanical drawing artist almost automatically lays down a triangle in order to draw a line in the desired place. Data entry for AutoCAD, by contrast, requires you to think in terms of coordinate positions rather than in the customary patterns of '''dimensioning'''.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20170421032951/https://www.nytimes.com/1985/11/19/science/personal-computers-designing-is-made-easy-by-autocad.html}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Alexander Olch|title=For the Moment &vert; Dreams Foretold|magazine=w:The New York Times Magazine|url=https://archive.nytimes.com/tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2008/02/21/for-the-moment-dreams-foretold/|date=2008-02-21|passage=Some people muse over real estate listings in the Sunday paper, looking at floor plans for apartments they could never afford, looking at an idea of what their life might be like with a properly '''dimensioned''' foyer.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20221126012000/https://archive.nytimes.com/tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2008/02/21/for-the-moment-dreams-foretold/}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Jim Robbins|title=Portable Housing, Made in Montana|magazine=w:The New York Times|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2010/08/12/garden/12portable.html|date=2010-08-11|passage=“The shape seems simple,” Bruce Leep said. “But very precise '''dimensioning''' is required. It was difficult to figure out how all of these angles come together.”|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20220617100546/https://www.nytimes.com/2010/08/12/garden/12portable.html}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=Michael Thomas De Vlieger|title=Multiplication Tables of Various Bases|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230206072619/https://www.numberbases.com/essay/MultiplicationSynopsis.pdf|date=2014-11-24|page=43|work=The Number Base|passage=The first sixty argam form the basis for my own sexagesimal use, in the accounting of my business and in the '''dimensioning''' of buildings.}}
