#* {{quote-journal|en-US|author=Mark Landler|title=Princess of Wales Apologizes, Saying She Edited Image|work=The New York Times|date=2024-03-11|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/11/world/europe/princess-kate-middleton-photo-edit-apology.html|issn=0362-4331|author2=Lauren Leatherby|passage=Catherine, the Princess of Wales, apologized on Monday for '''doctoring''' a photo of her with her three children, which was recalled by several news agencies on Sunday after they determined the image had been manipulated.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[adulterate]], [[drug]]{{,}} or [[poison]] (drink).
#* {{RQ:Bramah Max Carrados|passage=There is no doubt that a few months ago Creake deliberately planned to poison her with some weed-killer. {{...}} The gist of it was that she had the strongest suspicion that Creake '''doctored''' a bottle of stout which he expected she would drink for her supper when she was alone.}}
