#* {{quote-book|en|author=Havelock Ellis|chapter=|title=Studies in the Psychology of Sex|url=http://www.gutenberg.org/files/13611/13611-h/13611-h.htm|year=1927|volume=2|passage=If we turn to the New World, we find that among the American Indians, from the Eskimo of Alaska '''downward''' to Brazil and still farther south, homosexual customs have been very frequently observed.}}

